<title>UK: S&amp;N first half profits up 26 percent.</title>
<headline>S&amp;N first half profits up 26 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to October 27</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		24.3		   vs 20.6</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 7.21		   vs 6.55</p>
<p> Pretax		    195.1		   vs 158.2</p>
<p> Turnover		  1.665 bln	     vs 1.345 bln</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 178 and 198 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Scottish and Newcastle Plc</p>
</text>
